<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Find your table</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,500;0,600;1,600&family=Inter:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<!--
  ============================================================
  HOW TO CONNECT YOUR GOOGLE SHEET  (do this once)
  ============================================================
  1. Your sheet needs exactly 3 columns, in this order, with a header row:
       First Name | Last Name | Table Number
     Example:
       First Name | Last Name | Table Number
       Jordan     | Lee       | 7
       Priya      | Patel     | 3

  2. In Google Sheets: File > Share > Publish to web.
     - Under "Link", choose the specific sheet/tab your guest list is on.
     - Change the format dropdown from "Web page" to "Comma-separated values (.csv)".
     - Click Publish.
     - Copy the link it gives you (it will look like:
       https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/e/2PACX-xxxxxxxx/pub?output=csv)

  3. Paste that link into SHEET_CSV_URL below, replacing the placeholder text.

  4. Save this file and open it in a browser (or host it anywhere, e.g. GitHub
     Pages, Netlify). It will fetch the live sheet every time someone opens
     the page, so you can keep updating table numbers right up to the big day.

  IMPORTANT: "Publish to web" makes the sheet's data readable by anyone with
  the link (read-only, they can't edit it, and they'd need the exact long
  link, which is not guessable). Don't publish anything sensitive on that tab.
  ============================================================
-->

<style>
  :root {
    --rose: #C0392B;
    --pink-mid: #D9748A;
    --ink: #4A2530;
    --muted: #B79399;
    --bg: #FFFBF8;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    margin: 0;
    min-height: 100vh;
    background: var(--bg);
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 24px;
  }
  .card {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    max-width: 540px;
    width: 100%;
    background: var(--bg);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 3rem 1.75rem;
    text-align: center;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(74, 37, 48, 0.08);
  }
  .flower { position: absolute; }
  .content { position: relative; z-index: 1; }
  .eyebrow {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 16px;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    color: var(--rose);
    margin: 0 0 6px;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
  h1 {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 28px;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin: 0 0 28px;
  }
  .search-row {
    display: flex;
    gap: 8px;
    max-width: 340px;
    margin: 0 auto 8px;
  }
  #nameInput {
    flex: 1;
    height: 44px;
    border-radius: 22px;
    border: 1px solid #EAC4C9;
    background: #FFFFFF;
    padding: 0 18px;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--ink);
    outline: none;
  }
  #nameInput:focus { border-color: var(--rose); }
  #findBtn {
    height: 44px;
    padding: 0 22px;
    border-radius: 22px;
    border: 1px solid var(--rose);
    background: var(--rose);
    color: #FFFBF8;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 500;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  #findBtn:hover { background: #A83226; }
  #findBtn:disabled { opacity: 0.6; cursor: default; }
  #statusMsg {
    font-size: 13px;
    min-height: 18px;
    margin: 0 0 16px;
  }
  #statusMsg.error { color: var(--rose); }
  #statusMsg.loading { color: var(--muted); }
  #results { margin-top: 8px; }
  .result-item {
    margin: 0 0 20px;
  }
  .result-item .prefix {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 17px;
    color: #8C5A63;
    margin: 0 0 4px;
  }
  .result-item .table-line {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 42px;
    color: var(--rose);
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.15;
  }
  .celebrate {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin: 6px 0 0;
  }
  .hint {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin: 26px 0 0;
  }
  .sr-only {
    position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px;
    overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0,0,0,0);
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

